in_scope_clauses.summary:
Processor obligations + DPA (Data Processing Agreement)
required content per Article 28(3): subject-matter + duration;
nature + purpose; type of personal data + categories of data
subjects; controller obligations + rights; processor
obligations (act on documented instructions only; confidentiality;
Article 32 security; sub-processor authorisation; assist with
data-subject rights; assist with breach notification + DPIA;
delete/return data at end; audit rights + information). Standard
Contractual Clauses (Implementing Decision 2021/915) +
Commission-approved codes of conduct (Article 40) acceptable.

Monitoring + measurement + analysis + evaluation — what is
monitored + how + when + by whom; effectiveness of BC measures;
results documented + retained as evidence.
